WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.346
In this module, we create your school's ScoreCode portal. It takes about two minutes, and you only do it once.

00:00:09.226 --> 00:00:12.582
Open the ScoreCode website and go to the sign-up page.

00:00:13.773 --> 00:00:20.545
Type your school's name exactly as it should appear on marksheets. Here, we type Sunrise Public School.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:30.392
ScoreCode suggests a portal address from the name. Check that it says Available. Students and staff will use this address to sign in.

00:00:33.244 --> 00:00:37.560
Choose the type of institution. For a CBSE school, choose School.

00:00:38.598 --> 00:00:49.508
Now enter your name and your email address. In this example, the principal, Mrs. Sunita Sharma, is creating the portal. The email address here is fictional.

00:00:50.213 --> 00:00:56.827
Choose a strong password of at least twelve characters that you do not use anywhere else. Keep it private.

00:00:59.071 --> 00:01:04.639
Click Create portal. ScoreCode now sends a verification email to the address you entered.

00:01:06.219 --> 00:01:15.194
Open that email and click the link inside it. This proves the email address is yours. In this demonstration, we open the link directly.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:24.993
Your portal is ready, and you are signed in as the owner. The setup checklist shows the steps to complete before your first examination.

00:01:26.739 --> 00:01:34.701
A new portal starts on the Free plan, for up to one hundred and fifty students. ScoreCode can change your plan later.

00:01:37.058 --> 00:01:44.218
In the next module, we set up the academic structure: the session, the class and section, and the subjects.
